# Raw per-run consoles: ~98 MB and regenerable by the runners. The CURATED
# evidence in results/ (scorecards, delta study, the .tsv result tables) IS
# tracked -- see the un-ignore rules below. A claim in a .md here is only as
# good as the .tsv beside it, so the tables ship with the prose.
results/*
!results/*.md
!results/*.tsv

# Renode test-failure dumps and rotated logs: artefacts of a run, not of the model.
snapshots/
logs/
*.log
